<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Task 1 - HTML Form and Express</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 620px; margin: 50px auto; padding: 0 18px; color: #222; }
    form { display: grid; gap: 12px; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 8px; }
    input, button { font: inherit; padding: 10px; }
    button { cursor: pointer; background: #1f5eff; color: white; border: 0; border-radius: 5px; }
    .message { margin-top: 18px; padding: 12px; background: #eef4ff; border-radius: 5px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Task 1: HTML Structure and Basic Server Interaction</h1>
  <p>Enter your name and submit the form. Express handles the request and EJS renders the response.</p>
  <form action="/submit" method="POST">
    <label for="name">Name</label>
    <input id="name" name="name" type="text" value="<%= submittedName %>" placeholder="Enter your name" required>
    <button type="submit">Submit</button>
  </form>
  <% if (message) { %>
    <p class="message"><%= message %></p>
  <% } %>
</body>
</html>
